  - Portrait: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a179e59b5dad9a946ab39766eaaaf094, type: 2}
    Sentence: You didn't get the milk, did you?
  - Portrait: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a179e59b5dad9a946ab39766eaaaf094, type: 2}
